      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you mean aosp/2626248? aosp/2654319 adds new properties for a `prebuilt_build_tool`-like module type, but doesn\u0027t use `toolchain_srcs`.\n\nI\u0027m happy to add a `toolchain_data` property, but I think that the current uses of `toolchain_srcs` in aosp/2626248 are all compile-time only dependencies since they\u0027re only ingested by `rustc` but aren\u0027t used at runtime, and so I think they should be `srcs` and not `data`. Could you give a link to what you think would be better as a `data` property?",
